//Host-function fixture, LIBRARY form: the same native declaration as
//hostfns.n but without main(). The two test families interlock on one
//unit otherwise — the v1 suite loads hostfns.ncu directly and load()
//requires an entry point (so hostfns.n must keep main()), while the
//ad-hoc import path forbids importing a main-defining module (Layer 6:
//main is reserved for the root module). Importing tests use this
//variant; the host satisfies now() via registerHostFunction
//("hostfns_lib", "now").
native int now();
